sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant DP as 文档列表页
    participant HD as useDocuments Hook
    participant API as GET /api/documents
    participant SB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    Note over U,SB: 场景1: 文档搜索 + 排序

    U->>DP: 输入搜索关键词 "需求"
    DP->>HD: 防抖300ms后调用 refresh({search:"需求", sort:"updated_desc"})
    HD->>API: fetchApi(`/api/documents?type=owned&search=需求&sort=updated_desc`)
    API->>SB: SELECT ... FROM documents WHERE owner_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL AND title ILIKE '%需求%' ORDER BY updated_at DESC
    SB-->>API: 返回匹配文档列表
    API-->>HD: {code:200, data:[...], message:"ok"}
    HD-->>DP: 更新 documents state
    DP->>DP: DocCard 中 highlightText("需求文档A", "需求") 渲染高亮
    DP-->>U: 显示搜索结果，关键词高亮

    Note over U,SB: 场景2: 软删除 → 回收站

    U->>DP: 点击删除按钮
    DP->>DP: Modal.confirm("文档将移入回收站，30天后自动删除")
    U->>DP: 确认删除
    DP->>API: DELETE /api/documents/{id}
    API->>SB: UPDATE documents SET deleted_at=now() WHERE id=?
    SB-->>API: 更新成功
    API-->>DP: {code:200, message:"文档已移入回收站"}
    DP-->>U: 列表移除该文档

    Note over U,SB: 场景3: 回收站恢复

    U->>DP: 进入回收站 /trash
    DP->>API: GET /api/trash
    API->>SB: SELECT ... FROM documents WHERE owner_id=? AND deleted_at IS NOT NULL
    SB-->>API: 返回已删除文档列表
    API-->>DP: 显示回收站列表
    U->>DP: 点击恢复
    DP->>API: PATCH /api/trash/{id}
    API->>SB: UPDATE documents SET deleted_at=NULL WHERE id=?
    SB-->>API: 恢复成功
    API-->>DP: {code:200, message:"文档已恢复"}
    DP-->>U: 文档从回收站消失，回到文档列表

    Note over U,SB: 场景4: 密码重置(MVP)

    U->>U: 点击"忘记密码?"
    U->>API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password {email}
    API->>SB: SELECT id FROM users WHERE email=?
    SB-->>API: 用户存在
    API->>API: 生成 rawToken = crypto.randomBytes(32).hex
    API->>API: token_hash = SHA256(rawToken)
    API->>SB: INSERT password_reset_tokens(user_id, token_hash, expires_at=now()+1h)
    API-->>U: {code:200, data:{token:"rawToken"}}
    U->>U: 跳转 /reset-password?token=rawToken
    U->>API: POST /api/auth/reset-password {token, new_password}
    API->>API: SHA256(token) → token_hash
    API->>SB: SELECT * FROM password_reset_tokens WHERE token_hash=? AND used=false AND expires_at>now()
    SB-->>API: token有效
    API->>API: bcryptjs.hash(new_password) → password_hash
    API->>SB: UPDATE users SET password_hash=? WHERE id=?
    API->>SB: UPDATE password_reset_tokens SET used=true WHERE id=?
    API-->>U: {code:200, message:"密码重置成功"}
    U->>U: 跳转 /login

    Note over U,SB: 场景5: Vercel Cron 自动清理

    participant CRON as Vercel Cron
    CRON->>API: GET /api/cron/cleanup-trash (Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET)
    API->>API: 验证 CRON_SECRET
    API->>SB: DELETE FROM documents WHERE deleted_at < now() - interval '30 days'
    SB-->>API: 删除N条记录
    API-->>CRON: {code:200, data:{deleted_count:N}}
